    "decode": "Find record whose atlas_uv rectangle contains texel. pixel_to_native_barycentric @ [local_x+0.5,local_y+0.5,1] yields raw native triangle barycentrics. Clamp each to >=0 and normalize for covered-margin sampling; native_triangle gives source vertex rows. source_uv, high_source face/bary and baseline IDs live in frozen NPZ. Alpha uses unprojected pixel center and oriented edge distances. Non-new upper-left pixels map to identical legacy coordinates; unused pixels are transparent zero-color and neutral normal.",
